      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "High Point, the tallest spot in Seattle at 520 feet, sits just west of central Delridge and offers a quiet overlook of the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delridge%2C_Seattle",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Delridge neighborhood is shaping itself into a transit‑oriented community with new light rail stations planned to connect residents to downtown and beyond.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
